# Enemy_ShieldKnight - silver helm with a red plume and a dark visor with glowing eyes, blue armour, a big blue
# heater shield with a gold rim and a gold cross held in front, short sword on the left
# (Tools/Blender/enemies/models_enemies.py shield_knight). Light top-left.
